Derived from Omarchy v3.8.4:

  - themes/*/colors.toml — the palettes. The 22 slot keys are unchanged from
    v3.8.4; the names past them (selection, muted, the background and
    foreground shades, orange, brown) are their values from Omarchy master,
    where the palette grew those names. Where the two versions overlap they
    agree, so the two halves are the same colours either way.
  - templates/btop.theme.tpl — unchanged
  - templates/ghostty.conf.tpl — unchanged
  - the {{ key }} / {{ key_strip }} / {{ key_rgb }} template substitutions,
    and rendering them by building a sed script from colors.toml
  - staging generated files in a scratch directory and swapping it into place
    with a single mv

Written for narchy: the app definition format, detection, the link/unlink
commands, and the remaining templates.

